    "text": "Growth has taught me that putting myself first doesn’t always mean choosing isolation. There’s strength in honouring your own needs, but there’s also grace in partnership.⁠\n⁠\n— In learning how to hold space for each other.⁠\n— In taking turns.⁠\nA healthy connection allows room for both people to breathe, to bend, to be human. 🌻⁠\n— It’s not about keeping score.⁠\n— It’s about showing up when it matters most.⁠\n⁠\nAnd not forgetting yourself in the process.⁠\n⁠\nLeave a 💚 if this resonated with you⁠",
